    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) organised a media roundtable on sustainability, bringing together journalists, academics, and experts to discuss the university's efforts towards environmental stewardship and its commitment to more sustainable practices in the context of the climate crisis. The roundtable aimed to raise awareness about the importance of sustainability and engage with the media and stakeholders to inspire dialogue and collective action towards a greener and more sustainable future.",
